{"created": "2025-04-18T11:31:00.307369+00:00", "modified": "2025-04-18T11:31:00.820261+00:00", "id": 14230064, "conceptrecid": "14230063", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14230064", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.14230063", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14230064", "metadata": {"title": "Dataset for Increasing the Spatial Resolution of Harmful Cyanobacterial Bloom Detection using Deep Learning and Sentinel-2 Satellite Imagery", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14230064", "publication_date": "2024-11-27", "description": "<p>Contains a training set and a test set. The features are <a href=\"https://oceancolor.gsfc.nasa.gov/about/projects/cyan/\">CyAN </a>image patches that have been interpolated to 20m resolution. The labels are geographically overlapping patches of Sentinel 2 level 2A images where all bands have been interpolated to 20m. The training set has been divided into 5 files based on CyAN region for ease of download.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "H\u00e4nsch, Ronny", "affiliation": "Technische Universit\u00e4t Berlin", "orcid": "0000-0002-2936-6765"}, {"name": "Schloer, Conrad", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0000-0001-9414-722X"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "14230063"}}]}}, "title": "Dataset for Increasing the Spatial Resolution of Harmful Cyanobacterial Bloom Detection using Deep Learning and Sentinel-2 Satellite Imagery", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14230064", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/14230064", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/14230064?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14230064", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14230064", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.14230064", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14230064/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records